#: smtp.cc:606
msgid ""
"Your SMTP server claims to support TLS, but negotiation was unsuccessful.\n"
"You can disable TLS in KDE using the crypto settings module."
msgstr ""
"jou smtp bediener maak aanspraak aan ondersteun tls, maar onderhandeling was onsuksesvol.\n"
"jy kan deaktiveer tls in kde te gebruik die kripto instellings module."

#: smtp.cc:611
msgid "Connection Failed"
msgstr "verbinding gevaal"

#: smtp.cc:645
msgid ""
"Your SMTP server does not support TLS. Disable TLS, if you want to connect "
"without encryption."
msgstr ""
"jou smtp bediener doen nie ondersteun tls. deaktiveer tls, as jy wil hê aan konnekteer "
"sonder om te enkripsie."

